        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Maki Nomiya, Conrad Lant, Cronos\n- Bands: Pizzicato Five, Venom\n- Albums: Prime Evil\n- Topics: music careers, band lineup changes\n\nFacts:\n- Maki Nomiya was born on March 12, 1960, and is a Japanese singer and musician.\n- Conrad Thomas Lant was born on January 15, 1963, and is an English musician who is also known by the stage name Cronos.\n- In the late 1980s, after personnel changes, Pizzicato Five gained international fame as a duo consisting of Konishi and vocalist Maki Nomiya.\n- Prime Evil is the sixth studio album by the heavy metal band Venom.\n- Prime Evil was the first Venom album not to feature bassist and vocalist Conrad \"Cronos\" Lant.",
